        "heading": "The Report",
        "text": "The pre-export mortality rate of wild birds in the trade is up to 90%. Every year, millions of wild birds are taken from their natural habitat and forced to spend the rest of their lives in cages.\n\nTo comprehend the vastness of the poaching industry in Southeast Asia, Thrive Conservation compiled a detailed report for the campaign on it's current state.",
        "button": {
          "label": "Read Full Report",
          "href": "https://thriveconservation.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Broken-Wings-Report-2023_FINAL.pdf"
        }
      },
